# ACT4 tests the golden model (the old core, test/golden/MANIFEST) cannot run:
# it fails their self-check (tohost 3) by its known deviations from the
# specification (mstatus/sstatus field writes, PMP and interrupt causes,
# pointer masking, FCVT corner cases, the Sv trap status word) or, for Zkt,
# by a one-cycle difference between the two timed runs of an op, and the
# Zawrs WRS.NTO timeout loops never end on it. Found by test/golden/run_golden.py at the 8b9ddedc pin (MI step 2).
# gen_suite.py gives them lockstep=0: GA judges them by pass/fail only.
